OL,3,GNEWSAMet needs to move away from
OL,4,Acriminalising sex workers, officers say
OL,5,Aafter Levy failings
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Met need to move away from
OL,8,Fcriminalising women involved in street
OL,9,Fsex work in the wake of the Simon Levy
OL,10,Fcase, officers have told the BBC.
OL,12,FLevy, a convicted sex offender, was
OL,13,Fleft to kill two women and rape another
OL,14,F- all of whom were vulnerable and
OL,15,Fsometimes engaged in street sex work -
OL,16,Fdue to a series of failings, including
OL,17,Fby the force.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
