OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMet needs to move away from
OL,4,Acriminalising sex workers, officers say
OL,5,Aafter Levy failings
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow the Met is piloting a new
OL,8,Ftwo-officer female team in north London
OL,9,Fto engage with street sex workers, in a
OL,10,Fbid to improve trust and encourage them
OL,11,Fto report crimes committed against
OL,12,Fthem.
OL,14,FThe Levy case exposed grave failings in
OL,15,Fpolicing and also the inherent tension
OL,16,Fin its approach to street sex workers.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
